Check assign_compliance_certificate: candidate_prepared and compliance_certificate_available.

Check apply_operational_constraint precondition: candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, operational_constraint_available, candidate_operational_constraint_linked, not constraint_applied. We have candidate_task_profile_linked (we attached before). candidate_operational_constraint_linked is true from init for each candidate. operational_constraint_available initially true for each. Not constraint_applied initially false. Good.

Check confirm_operator_alignment precondition: constraint_applied and candidate_operator_linked and not operator_alignment_confirmed. We have constraint_applied after apply step, candidate_operator_linked true from assign_operator_resource, operator_alignment_confirmed false. Good.

Check verify_compliance_certificate precondition: operator_alignment_confirmed and candidate_compliance_certificate_linked and not compliance_validation_complete. We have operator_alignment_confirmed true after step40/57, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked true from assign_compliance_certificate, compliance_validation_complete false. Good.

Check finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation precondition: compliance_validation_complete and not candidate_finalized. We have compliance_validation_complete true after verify step, candidate_finalized false. Good.

Effect: candidate_finalized true, dispatch_ready true.

